Isolate uncertain peripheral teardown in esp_board_manager 0.5.15.

A deinitializer may consume its handle before returning an error. Keep the first
error in a private wrapper, hide the handle, and reject subsequent lifecycle
operations until restart. Batch operations continue other nodes and return their
first error. No public structure or generated board definition changes.

